<title>ITALY: Conserve Italia buys French Verjame.</title>
<headline>Conserve Italia buys French Verjame.</headline>
<dateline>BOLOGNA, Italy 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conserve Italia, with a total turnover of 900 billion lire, said it is to acquire France's Verjame SA, the country's leading fruit conserver with sales of 110 billion lire.</p>
<p>Conserve Italia, which owns the brands Valfrutta, Yoga, Derby, Jolly Colombani and Mon Jardin, said in a statement the purchase would create Europe's leading group in the sector, but gave no financial details.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
